<title>USA: Mercedes A-class sales exceed expectations - Daimler.</title>
<headline>Mercedes A-class sales exceed expectations - Daimler.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Demand for Mercedes' new A-class compact car is exceeding company expectations, Daimler-Benz AG Chief Executive Juergen Schrempp told a news conference on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We have always believed it will be a great success. But what is happening presently is beyond our expectations,&quot; he said. He gave no figures.</p>
</text>
